tory of a group or nation "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We walked the heritage trail."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rare"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not common or usual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There were rare birds nesting near the water."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aquatic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "living or found in areas of water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There were a lot of aquatic birds in the area."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pitch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to set up"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally pitched her tent in a small, creek bed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "creek bed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the bottom of a dried up creek"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There was no water in the creek bed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sleeping bag"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a warm, long bag used for sleeping"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We brought our sleeping bags with them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fort"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a strong building or group of buildings where soldiers live"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The tour guide took us on a tour of the fort."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lush"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "covered with healthy, green plants"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We wandered past along the lush trails."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le15ob08aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research a location or attraction in another part of the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are a blogger. Write an 80-word blog."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe what you see and do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adjectives to describe the area."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your blog aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research locations around the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a blog about a location or attraction."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives to describe places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my blog aloud to a partner for speaking practice."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le15ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "The Beauty of Boston Harbor</p> Recently, I went on a tour of Boston's Harbor islands. What an amazing experience! I boarded a little, black bus in the center of town early Saturday morning and headed for the ferry terminal. After a 30-minute ferry ride, we landed on Spectacle Island. Our friendly, young guide led us on a tour of a Civil War-era fort and historic lighthouses.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "It was interesting to learn about early European settlement in the area. After lunch, our group hiked the lush, wide trails and attended an interesting information session on the wetland and aquatic wildlife in the area. The speaker also talked about the Natural Heritage Program that lists six rare species that live within this famous, American park.", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn5le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I decided to bring my new camping equipment and camp under the stars. Unfortunately, it started to rain in the middle of the night. I didn't realize that I pitched my tent in a small creek bed.  I woke up in the morning in a wet sleeping bag! It was a soggy mess.", "id": 3, "time": "58000", "image": "engenn5le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le15ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write about places and attractions in a city."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe places. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a short text. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What does a \u201cspecial\u201d place mean? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Can you think of a special place to visit where you live? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_nam